retrieved: 2026-11-22
method: each aosp row's resource name read in the Android Open Source Project's own files, fetched from
  android.googlesource.com with ?format=TEXT at the last tag of each release from Android 10 to 17 (android-10.0.0_r47,
  11.0.0_r48, 12.0.0_r34, 12.1.0_r27, 13.0.0_r84, 14.0.0_r75, 15.0.0_r36, 16.0.0_r4, 17.0.0_r1), by
  scripts/android-labels.py --fetch, which also writes the texts the checks compare with
  (scripts/testdata/android-labels-aosp.tsv, the Android Open Source Project's text, Apache-2.0).
repositories: settings = platform/packages/apps/Settings, res/values*/strings.xml; settingslib =
  platform/frameworks/base, packages/SettingsLib/res/values*/strings.xml, merged into Settings' package
  (com.android.settings) under the same names; permissioncontroller = platform/packages/apps/PackageInstaller,
  res/values*/strings.xml, for Android 11, whose permission controller held the switch for unused apps.
rows: 22 for 21 labels, all aosp, each name present at every tag of its range. A maker's rows are added as the
  coordinator reads them on a device (MainActivity's debug command labels-find), each with the model and build it
  was read on.
